    "name": "team_item_read",
    "description": "Read every field of a Team, member or Team-owned Project using bounded inspect/chunk calls. Inspect gives complete fixed metadata, nullable field sizes and a revision based on exact last-modified timestamps. Chunk defaults to UTF-8 text and 8KiB source bytes; maxBytes above8192 explicitly allows a larger response. On version_conflict discard this item and inspect again. Decode each base64 chunk separately before joining bytes. After reading a list boundary item, continue using its cursorAfterItem.",
